{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-genui-untagged-fence",
  "description": "DSH web client plugin: 让漏写 dsh-ui 标签的界面围栏照样渲染——扫描助手回复里没带语言标签、正文却是界面规格的代码块，补上 dsh-ui 标签，交给 @changfenhuang/dsh-genui 的 DOM 通道接管。不改 DSH 源码，也不改 dsh-genui 的代码，卸载即恢复原样。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "cordis": ">=4.0.0-0"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
